            </note>
            <note corresp="#d519-f2" n="87" xml:id="d519-f2-content">
                <p>Amtorg Trading Corporation, 261 Fifth Avenue, New York, N. Y., official
                    purchasing and sales agency in the United States of the Soviet Union.</p>
            </note>
